                "use_product_description_1": false,
                "content_1": "<p>Experience deeper sleep, less pain, and calmer mornings, all from the comfort of your bed. Terra Therapy’s grounding sheets are woven with 400 thread count organic cotton and 10% pure silver fiber to deliver a safe, comfortable, and effective grounding connection every night.</p><p>Plug into any grounded outlet and let Earth’s natural electrons flow through the sheet to support your body’s recovery, from better sleep and reduced inflammation to calmer nervous system function.</p><p>No EMFs. No batteries. Just effortless, science-backed healing while you sleep.</p>",
